BattleFrontier_BattleTowerLobby_EventScript_RulesBoard_Text:
	.string "THE TEN GAUNTLETS - RULES\p"
	.string "Six POKéMON, all at level 50. Your\n"
	.string "team is locked once a run begins.\p"
	.string "Six battles, then the boss. Full\n"
	.string "heal after every battle. Held\l"
	.string "items come back; BAG items can't\l"
	.string "be used.\p"
	.string "No two POKéMON on a team may hold\n"
	.string "the same item.\p"
	.string "The TOWER holds gauntlets 1 to 4:\n"
	.string "Singles, Doubles, Singles,\l"
	.string "Doubles.$"

Facility_Text_AlreadyCleared:
	.string "You've already cleared this\n"
	.string "gauntlet.\p"
	.string "There's no going back here. Only\n"
	.string "forward!$"

Facility_B1_Text_Commotion:
	.string "...Oh! While you were battling,\n"
	.string "there was quite a commotion over\l"
	.string "at the DOUBLES mat.\p"
	.string "Some man stormed in and started\n"
	.string "shouting at the attendant there.\l"
	.string "You might want to go and see what\l"
	.string "happened.$"

Facility_B2_Text_NormanCameIn:
	.string "Oh... you're {PLAYER}, aren't you?\p"
	.string "I'm sorry. I can't let you take on\n"
	.string "this gauntlet.\p"
	.string "A GYM LEADER came in while you\n"
	.string "were battling. NORMAN, from\l"
	.string "PETALBURG. He demanded that I not\l"
	.string "let you challenge any more\l"
	.string "gauntlets.\p"
	.string "I tried to explain the rules, but\n"
	.string "he wouldn't hear it.\p"
	.string "On his way out, he said SCOTT has\n"
	.string "been playing games with other\l"
	.string "people's children for long\l"
	.string "enough... and that he was going to\l"
	.string "go put a stop to it.\p"
	.string "Maybe you should go see SCOTT.$"

Facility_B2_Text_JuanApology:
	.string "JUAN: ...Should you ever meet\n"
	.string "WALLACE...\p"
	.string "Tell him I'm sorry.$"

Facility_B2_Text_StevenHook:
	.string "Oh, one more thing. A man in a\n"
	.string "suit watched your whole battle\l"
	.string "from the back of the lobby.\p"
	.string "He left before it ended, but he\n"
	.string "asked me to tell you he'd be\l"
	.string "waiting in the HALL OF TEN.$"

Facility_B4_Text_POSDown:
	.string "I'm sorry. The LINK MULTI mat is\n"
	.string "closed. The whole island's system\l"
	.string "went down, and nothing's running\l"
	.string "until it's fixed.\p"
	.string "Folks say there's been someone\n"
	.string "shady hanging around out past the\l"
	.string "PALACE lately. I bet he knows\l"
	.string "something about it.$"

Facility_B4_Text_StevenHook:
	.string "Oh, and that man in the suit is\n"
	.string "back. He asked me to tell you he's\l"
	.string "waiting in the HALL OF TEN again.$"

Facility_Text_UseSecondWind:
	.string "You still have a SECOND WIND.\p"
	.string "Use it to fight this battle again?$"

Facility_Text_SecondWindUsed:
	.string "{PLAYER} used the SECOND WIND!\p"
	.string "The team caught its breath. Back\n"
	.string "into the battle!$"

Facility_B4_Text_POSDownLooker:
	.string "I'm sorry. The LINK MULTI mat is\n"
	.string "still closed. The system's still\l"
	.string "down.\p"
	.string "They say a detective from the\n"
	.string "International Police is\l"
	.string "investigating out past the PALACE.\l"
	.string "Maybe he knows when it'll be\l"
	.string "fixed.$"

Facility_B3_Text_StevenWaiting:
	.string "I'm sorry, I can't let you onto\n"
	.string "this mat just yet.\p"
	.string "The man in the suit was very\n"
	.string "clear. He wants to see you in the\l"
	.string "HALL OF TEN before you go any\l"
	.string "further.\p"
	.string "I'd go see him. He didn't strike\n"
	.string "me as someone who likes to wait.$"
